Derived data
  crates/rusty-faker-core/data/**/*.json
  Extracted from Faker 40.39.0 by tools/extract_faker_data.py and compiled into
  static Rust tables by crates/rusty-faker-core/build.rs. These files ship inside
  every wheel.

Derived code
  python/rusty_faker/proxy.py                  (from faker.proxy)
  python/rusty_faker/generator.py              (from faker.generator)
  python/rusty_faker/factory.py                (from faker.factory)
  python/rusty_faker/config.py                 (from faker.config)
  python/rusty_faker/exceptions.py             (from faker.exceptions)
  python/rusty_faker/providers/__init__.py     (from faker.providers)
  python/rusty_faker/contrib/pytest/plugin.py  (from faker.contrib.pytest.plugin)
  python/rusty_faker/_tz.py                    (from faker.providers.date_time)

  crates/rusty-faker-core/src/providers/*.rs and crates/rusty-faker-py/src/lib.rs
  reimplement Faker's provider algorithms and public API in Rust.

